 connection to nature's bounty and a pragmatic approach to health and well-being that sustained them through the trials of their reigns.", 'terms': ['king yeongjo', 'king jeongjo', 'royal banquet'], 'audio_file': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\33580cf3-97c8-4db9-906b-4096ccb229f7\\audio.mp3', 'audio_duration': 105, 'subtitle_path': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\33580cf3-97c8-4db9-906b-4096ccb229f7\\subtitle.srt', 'materials': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-4aad1ae8d2b4c0f622a4a53a953beb7e.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-fd68d3140408edcc45f7b64fdb27c112.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-9c8fad35d2391e606d6b93524afd57d2.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-76323fb18b74159667dc62592c79eda0.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-ac0bffdea800952cc47a14b3c9468d35.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-4d7c758d83df73ec1f761bf6a7d92b29.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-f364259c8ba4feb6d9bc7340b77036e7.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-4de431b68fcdd409f7113bce253b02cb.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-fa29ab508d5907017ff717128d0a767c.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-5ad421cab2b1f58ab045e8fbbbc666bb.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-37cda7624caf5d6a87d833a62765f9d8.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-c24a1303c760adeb4b905839a29ccd25.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-a4eb4829d46cb204a1137025f84cc44f.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-000c7d6758c7e64581b603ab5842e0da.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-e02b9a42d4ce5edf7f45b3d0e60392c3.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-659fc3d88d448adc0c29a65b5598078b.mp4', 