## generating video script
2026-01-24 02:04:18 | DEBUG | "./app\services\task.py:35": generate_script - video script: 
If you've been diagnosed with diabetes, you must make a crucial decision for your health right now. You must completely eliminate three deadly temptations that are the main culprits behind blood sugar spikes and mercilessly overwork your pancreas. First and foremost, you must absolutely avoid liquid fructose and refined carbohydrates. Sweet drinks, snacks, and white bread will cause your blood sugar to skyrocket and further worsen insulin resistance. Next, processed foods and fast food must permanently disappear from your table. These foods, laden with trans fats and sodium, cause inflammation and destroy your vascular health. They are deficient in nutrients and packed only with calories, ultimately making blood sugar control more difficult. You must fill the void with fresh vegetables and protein, which will act as an antidote for your body. Finally, excessive alcohol consumption is nothing short of poison for your health. Alcohol impairs liver function and cripples your body's ability to regulate blood sugar, potentially leading to unpredictable hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia. The liver plays a crucial role in blood sugar regulation, but alcohol interferes with this function and adds only unnecessary calories. Remember that the temptation of a single drink can instantly undo your long efforts. Cutting out these three is not just about diet control; it's a courageous act that will save your life. It might be difficult at first, but by accumulating small successes every day, you'll feel your body and mind transform. For your health and future, start this change with a strong will from this very moment. You are strong enough and deserve to live a healthier life.
