2026-01-31 09:34:36 | DEBUG | "./app\services\task.py:35": generate_script - video script: 
A small habit of a spoonful of perilla oil, taken every morning at your dining table, is ready to completely transform your life. This precious drop is rich in alpha-linolenic acid (ALA), an omega-3 fatty acid, which activates brain function and effectively reduces chronic inflammatory responses. Your foggy, clouded mind will clear, and you'll be able to spend your day more productively with remarkable focus.

But perilla oil does more than just sharpen your mind. It comfortably soothes your sensitive stomach and intestines, resolving indigestion and promoting refreshing daily bowel movements, leading to a feeling of lightness in your body. Furthermore, it plays a key role in healthily regulating blood cholesterol levels and maintaining flexible blood vessels, thereby significantly lowering the risk of cardiovascular diseases.

Moreover, the powerful antioxidants in perilla oil protect cells from free radicals, robustly strengthening your immune system. This builds a resilient body that doesn't easily tire from seasonal colds or minor illnesses, while your skin will glow with deep hydration and vitality from within, helping to slow down the signs of aging. You'll experience the magic of your skin regaining its youthful radiance.

It's perfect in any way – whether as a salad dressing, a yogurt topping, or simply mixed into warm rice. Simply by consistently consuming one spoonful of perilla oil daily, your body and mind will undergo a fundamental transformation, gaining incomparable vitality and energy. Starting today, experience the beginning of this amazing change for yourself, reclaim your health and youth, and discover the best version of yourself!
